<h2>Mental health crisis</h2>
<p>If you or someone you know needs urgent mental health support, call 111 and choose the mental health option. In an emergency, call 999.</p>

<h2>Pharmacies</h2>
<p>Pharmacists can give advice and treatment for many minor illnesses without an appointment. Some pharmacies are open late and at weekends.</p>

<h2>When we are open</h2>
<p>If you need to speak to us urgently, call <a href="{{ practice.phone_link }}">{{ practice.phone_display }}</a> and tell us it is urgent. Do not use the online form for problems that cannot wait.</p>
{% endif %}
